OL,3,GNEWSACandidates named in six-way
OL,4,Aby-election race
OL,5,
OL,6,FCandidates have been confirmed for an
OL,7,Fupcoming by-election on a
OL,8,Ffinely-balanced Leicestershire council.
OL,10,FVoters will have the chance to elect a
OL,11,Fnew member for the Long Whatton and
OL,12,FDiseworth ward on North West
OL,13,FLeicestershire District Council on
OL,14,FThursday 1 October.
OL,16,FThe seat has been vacant since July,
OL,17,Fwhen Conservative councillor Nick
OL,18,FRushton died after being diagnosed with
OL,19,Fcancer.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
